---
import PixelEdges from "./PixelEdges.astro"
---

<section class="why">
    <PixelEdges left="tall" right="cluster" />
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <span class="eyebrow">Why we exist</span>
            <h2>Every team automated<br />its own corner.</h2>
        </header>
        <div class="text">
            <p>
                Kestra started in 2019 at Leroy Merlin, Europe's largest DIY
                retailer, where every team automated its own corner with its own
                tool and nobody could see the whole. Data had its scheduler,
                infrastructure its scripts, operations its runbooks. When
                something broke between them, no one owned it.
            </p>
            <p>
                We built one place where all of it runs, is versioned, and can
                be audited. The engine is Apache 2.0 and developed in public.
                Kestra Enterprise and Kestra Cloud add the governance,
                scalability and support that large teams need.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
    @use "./style/section" as *;

    .why {
        @include section;
        position: relative;
        background: var(--ks-background-body);

        .container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr);
            gap: 4rem;

            @include media-breakpoint-down(lg) {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 1.5rem;
            }
        }
    }

    header {
        align-self: start;
        position: sticky;
        top: 7rem;

        @include media-breakpoint-down(lg) {
            position: static;
        }
    }

    .eyebrow {
        @include eyebrow;
    }

    h2 {
        @include title;
    }

    .text {
        p {
            margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
            font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 1.6vw, 1.375rem);
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--ks-content-secondary);

            &:first-child {
                color: var(--ks-content-primary);
            }
        }
    }
</style>
